---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';

const sacredBecomingCheckoutUrl = 'https://buy.stripe.com/4gM00j9peal58gL1D9cbC02';

const thresholds = [
  ['I', 'DECONSTRUCT', 'What are you ready to put down?', 'Release what was never yours to carry and make space for what comes next.'],
  ['II', 'DISCOVER', 'Who are you underneath all those shoulds?', "Meet the woman who's been there all along—and let her shine."],
  ['III', 'RECLAIM', 'What if you trusted your own voice again?', 'Speak your truth. Own your choices. Stand in your own authority.'],
  ['IV', 'ALIGN', 'What would it feel like for your life to flow with you instead of against you?', 'Bring what you want and how you live into alignment.'],
  ['V', 'CREATE', 'What are you ready to make real?', 'Turn intention into action. Move. Choose. Build. Create.'],
  ['VI', 'MANIFEST', 'What happens when the universe starts answering back?', 'Open to intuition, synchronicity, magic, and Aether—and see what begins to emerge around you.'],
  ['VII', 'INTEGRATE', 'What if all the pieces finally moved together?', "Bring what you've reclaimed, discovered, created, and received into harmony."],
  ['VIII', 'BECOME', 'Are you ready?', 'Cross the threshold. Let it become real.'],
];
---
<Base
  title="Sacred Becoming Mentorship | Tarot Flower"
  description="Sacred Becoming is Vanessa Hylande's private one-on-one mentorship journey for reconnecting with your authentic voice and creating a life that truly feels like yours."
  showBanner={false}
  additionalSchema={{
    '@type': 'Service',
    '@id': 'https://tarotflower.com/sacred-becoming/mentorship/#service',
    name: 'Sacred Becoming private mentorship',
    url: 'https://tarotflower.com/sacred-becoming/mentorship/',
    provider: { '@id': 'https://tarotflower.com/#vanessa-hylande' },
    offers: {
      '@type': 'Offer',
      price: '2500',
      priceCurrency: 'USD',
      availability: 'https://schema.org/InStock',
      url: sacredBecomingCheckoutUrl,
    },
  }}
>
  <main class="becoming-page becoming-temple">
    <section class="becoming-hero container">
      <div class="becoming-hero-art">
        <picture>
          <source
            media="(max-width: 768px)"
            srcset="/images/sacred-becoming/sacred-becoming-raven-hero-mobile.jpg"
          />
          <img
            src="/images/sacred-becoming/sacred-becoming-raven-hero-wide.jpg"
            alt="Vanessa Hylande with a raven and circular stone calendar above a dark ocean"
            width="1672"
            height="941"
            fetchpriority="high"
          />
        </picture>
      </div>

      <div class="becoming-hero-copy">
        <h1>THE SACRED BECOMING</h1>
        <p class="becoming-hero-highlights">
          <span>Nine private sessions.</span>
          <span>Eight Thresholds.</span>
          <span>I will guide you through yours.</span>
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="becoming-origin-story">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="becoming-story-opening">I’ve gone down into the underworld like Persephone herself. I’ve watched the life I knew turn to ashes—and learned how to rise from them.</p>
        <h2>I know thresholds.</h2>
        <p class="becoming-story-solitude">I had to cross mine alone.</p>
        <p class="becoming-story-emphasis">You don’t have to.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="becoming-presence container">
      <div class="becoming-intro">
        <div class="becoming-pentacle" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 500 500">
            <circle cx="250" cy="250" r="194"></circle>
            <circle cx="250" cy="250" r="171"></circle>
            <path d="M250 63 L294 197 L435 197 L321 280 L365 414 L250 331 L135 414 L179 280 L65 197 L206 197 Z"></path>
            <circle class="pentacle-core" cx="250" cy="250" r="18"></circle>
            <circle class="pentacle-node" cx="250" cy="63" r="5"></circle>
            <circle class="pentacle-node" cx="435" cy="197" r="5"></circle>
            <circle class="pentacle-node" cx="365" cy="414" r="5"></circle>
            <circle class="pentacle-node" cx="135" cy="414" r="5"></circle>
            <circle class="pentacle-node" cx="65" cy="197" r="5"></circle>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="becoming-opening-questions">
          <p>What are you ready to release?</p>
          <p>What are you ready to reclaim?</p>
          <p>What are you ready to create?</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="becoming-threshold-callout">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>YOU KNOW WHEN YOU'RE STANDING AT A THRESHOLD.</h2>
        <p class="threshold-feeling">You can feel it. Something needs to change—and it's up to you to make it happen.</p>
        <p class="threshold-questions">What would it feel like to wake up excited about your own life again? To trust yourself? To feel fully alive in your body? To feel that little spark of “Oh my God, what if I actually did it?”</p>
        <p class="becoming-possibility">What becomes possible when you choose yourself?</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="becoming-section becoming-work container">
      <h2>THIS IS THE WORK.</h2>
      <p class="becoming-work-personalization">Made for you. All of it.</p>
      <div class="becoming-work-pillars">
        <article>
          <h3>Your body.</h3>
          <p>A personal movement and fitness practice built around what you enjoy and what your body needs.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3>Your mind.</h3>
          <p>Reflection, conversation, breathwork, and journaling shaped around what you're working through.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3>Your spirit.</h3>
          <p>Personal rituals, guided meditations, tarot, intuition, music, sound, and practices created for your journey.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3>Your life.</h3>
          <p>We bring it all together and turn what you discover into choices, action, and change.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
      <p class="becoming-work-closing">No script. No one-size-fits-all program. We build the practice around you.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="becoming-section becoming-included becoming-thresholds-section container">
      <div class="threshold-chamber">
        <div class="threshold-intro">
          <h2>THE EIGHT THRESHOLDS</h2>
        </div>

        <ol class="thresholds">
          {thresholds.map(([numeral, name, question, description]) => (
            <li>
              <div>
                <h3><span class="threshold-number">{numeral}</span>{' '}<span class="threshold-dash">—</span> {name}</h3>
                <p class="threshold-question">{question}</p>
                <p>{description}</p>
              </div>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="walking-beside-you container">
      <div class="walking-portrait">
        <img src="/images/sacred-becoming/walking-beside-you.jpg" alt="Vanessa Hylande" loading="lazy" />
      </div>

      <div class="walking-copy">
        <h2>WALKING BESIDE YOU</h2>
        <p>I didn't invent Sacred Becoming. I discovered it by living it.</p>
        <p>I bring decades of experience as a professional ballet dancer with the Metropolitan Opera in New York, a 500-hour Yoga Alliance teacher, strength and HIIT coach, tarot reader, energy healer, musician, writer, entrepreneur, and lifelong student of symbolism, mythology, psychology, and the human experience.</p>
        <p>But some of my greatest teachers have been life itself. Grief, motherhood, surviving narcissistic abuse, rebuilding, and beginning again have taught me, again and again, how to trust my own voice.</p>
        <p>Along the way, I found inspiration in the Goddess—in her beauty and ferocity, her intuition, creativity, sensuality, wisdom, and power. Sacred Becoming is where everything I've learned, practiced, survived, and created comes together in the practice of embodying those qualities for ourselves.</p>
        <p>My role isn't to tell you who to become. It's to walk beside you and guide you while you discover it for yourself.</p>
        <a href="https://vanessahylande.com">Read more about my journey →</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="becoming-receive-section">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>WHAT YOU'LL RECEIVE</h2>
        <p class="session-count">Nine live one-on-one video sessions, personalized for you. <span>Minimum 60 minutes each.</span></p>
        <ul class="session-list">
          <li>Welcome &amp; Orientation</li>
          <li>Eight Threshold Sessions</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="becoming-exchange-section">
      <div class="sacred-exchange container">
        <h2>THE SACRED EXCHANGE</h2>
        <p class="exchange-question">Are you ready to make this exchange with me?</p>
        <p class="exchange-details">Nine private sessions. Eight Thresholds. My guidance, experience, creativity, and attention—devoted to your becoming.</p>
        <p class="exchange-price">$2,500 USD</p>
        <a class="exchange-cta" href={sacredBecomingCheckoutUrl}>I’m Ready</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="becoming-faq-section" aria-labelledby="becoming-faq-title">
      <div class="becoming-faq container">
        <h2 id="becoming-faq-title">FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS</h2>

        <div class="becoming-faq-list">
          <details>
            <summary>Do I need to be going through a major crisis or life transition?</summary>
            <div class="becoming-faq-answer">
              <p>Not at all. A threshold can be enormous, or it can be as simple as knowing you want more from your life without knowing exactly what that “more” is yet. Your life might look wonderful from the outside—and still, something inside you is asking for change. That’s a threshold, too.</p>
            </div>
          </details>

          <details>
            <summary>What actually happens during our sessions?</summary>
            <div class="becoming-faq-answer">
              <p>We begin with a deeper introductory session so I can understand you—what you're struggling with, what you want to change, what you're dreaming about, and what you want from your body, your life, and this experience.</p>
              <p>Then I go to work. Between our sessions, I create each Threshold specifically for you. That might mean designing your personal movement or fitness practice, recording a guided meditation or sound bath, creating a ritual around an intention, working with the cards when you need insight, or drawing from other practices that support what we're exploring.</p>
              <p>I’ll also give you practices and invitations to explore between sessions. Everything is elective. You might find that a session itself gives you exactly what you need, or you might want to spend time working deeply with what we've uncovered before moving forward. When we meet again, we'll begin with what has happened since—and continue from there.</p>
              <p>The Eight Thresholds are a continuous journey, but you set the pace.</p>
            </div>
          </details>

          <details>
            <summary>Do I need any experience with tarot, ritual, yoga, meditation, or spiritual practices?</summary>
            <div class="becoming-faq-answer">
              <p>Not at all. You can come to Sacred Becoming as a complete beginner or an experienced practitioner. Because the work is created around you, we'll use the practices that interest you, feel comfortable to you, and support what we're working on together. If something is completely new, I'll introduce you to it along the way.</p>
            </div>
          </details>

          <details>
            <summary>How long does the full Sacred Becoming journey take?</summary>
            <div class="becoming-faq-answer">
              <p>I recommend allowing at least nine weeks, with no more than one Threshold session per week. The space between sessions is part of the journey—it gives you time to explore the practices, process what comes up, and let the work become part of your life.</p>
              <p>But the pace is flexible. You may want more time with a particular Threshold, need to work around travel or life, or simply want some breathing room before continuing. We’ll move at a rhythm that supports you and your life.</p>
            </div>
          </details>

          <details>
            <summary>What happens after I click “I’m Ready”?</summary>
            <div class="becoming-faq-answer">
              <p>Once you enroll, you'll receive your Sacred Becoming introductory guide and questionnaire—a beautiful introduction to the journey ahead and a chance to tell me more about yourself before we begin.</p>
              <p>Then you'll hear from me personally. We'll connect by email or phone, whichever you prefer, and schedule our first private video session. From there, we'll work together directly throughout your Sacred Becoming journey.</p>
            </div>
          </details>

          <details>
            <summary>How do I know if Sacred Becoming is right for me?</summary>
            <div class="becoming-faq-answer">
              <p>If you want to bring body, mind, and spiritual practice together to create meaningful change in your life, Sacred Becoming is for you.</p>
              <p>This is your practice. This is your Sacred Becoming. I'm here to guide you, introduce you to tools and possibilities, and create practices around what works for you. You decide what resonates, what you want to explore, and what you want to carry forward.</p>
            </div>
          </details>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="becoming-testimonial-section">
      <blockquote class="becoming-testimonial container">
        <p>“I never thought that a woman could change the way I feel in my body, mind, soul. Vanessa made me trust in my inner strength, made me get in touch with my inner goddess and grow in a way I never thought possible.”</p>
        <cite>— <strong>Tara, Austria</strong></cite>
      </blockquote>
      <a class="exchange-cta becoming-final-cta" href={sacredBecomingCheckoutUrl}>I’m Ready</a>
    </section>
  </main>
</Base>
